BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CASABLANCA PRESS: THE FLYING MONKEYS PROJECT
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261109T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261128T232859
UID:4a6e394e6a61c8db4acef75a5852f2ed@njpoetryevents.com
DESCRIPTION:The term "flying monkeys" — borrowed from the Wicked Witch's
  enforcers in The Wizard of Oz — refers to people who a narcissist recru
 its\, whether consciously or unconsciously\, to extend their reach\, contr
 ol\, and influence beyond what they can achieve alone. Flying monkeys carr
 y messages\, gather information\, deliver guilt or pressure\, spread false
  narratives\, and otherwise serve the narcissist's agenda\, often while be
 lieving they are simply helping or mediating a conflict. “Flying Monkeys
  in Narcissistic Abuse: What They Are and How to Protect Yourself” ( Sim
 ply Psychology ) This project is based on a book that I have started writi
 ng\, titled The ABCs of Trump’s Flying Monkeys. The book is going to be 
 a collection of poems about Trump’s “enablers\,” placed in alphabeti
 cal order. Each letter of the alphabet has at least one name (ex. Q’Anon
 ) and some letters have more than one name (ex. B has 6 names). There are 
 60 names in all (and therefore 60 poems). I have written three poems alrea
 dy. I tried to use one of the almost 300 forms of poetry for each poem to 
 give the book variety. “Pam Bondi” is an acrostic sonnet. “Vladimir 
 Putin” is a haibun. And “I.C.E.” will be a set of acrostic haikus. &
 nbsp\; &nbsp\;I’m not looking for satire or humor as much as I am lookin
 g for how each qualifies as a flying monkey according to the definition ci
 ted above\, and what that person has done to earn that “honor.” Each o
 f the poets who participate in this project will be recognized for the poe
 m he/she wrote on the page with the poem\, and a brief 3-4 sentence biogra
 phy included in the back of the book. &nbsp\;Below is a list of the 60 fly
 ing monkeys I have identified and the role that entitles them to the title
 : (Once a name is taken by a poet\, that poet’s name will appear next to
  the name of the flying monkey\, in red.) A&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Samuel Al
 ito – US Supreme Court Justice - Pam Laskin B&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Steve
  Bannon – Republican Political Operative - Alex S. Johnson Scott Bessent
  – Secretary of the Treasury - Mike Jurkovic Todd Blanche – US Attorne
 y General - Rick Spisak Pam Bondi – Former US Attorney General - Christo
 pher Bogart Gregory Bovino – Former Commander-at-Large\, US Border Patro
 l - Joel Allegretti Doug Burgum – Secretary of the Interior C &nbsp\;&nb
 sp\;Aileen Cannon – US District Court Judge - Rich Luc Brendan Carr – 
 Chairman of the F.C.C. - Rick Spisak Roy Cohn – The Sorcerer - Raymond N
 at Turner Edward Coristine (“Big Balls”) – Head of Engineering\, W.H
 .N.D.S - Christopher Bogart D &nbsp\;&nbsp\;Department of War - Dario Cven
 cek D.O.G.E. – Department of Government Efficiency - Raymond Nat Turner 
 &nbsp\; Byron Donalds – US Representative (R/FL) - Pam Laskin Sean Duffy
  – US Secretary of Transportation - Pam Laskin E &nbsp\;&nbsp\;Larry and
  David Ellison – Billionaires\, Co-Founders of Oracle\, owners of Skydan
 ce-Paramount Global. - Richard Loranger F &nbsp\;&nbsp\;Michael Flynn – 
 Retired US Army Lieutenant General. - Joel Allegretti G &nbsp\;&nbsp\;Tuls
 i Gabbard – Director of National Intelligence Kimberly Guilfoyle – for
 mer US Ambassador to Greece - Linda Muhlhausen H &nbsp\;&nbsp\;Alina Habba
  – Counselor to the President Natalie Harp – “Special” Presidentia
 l Assistant - Ellyn Maybe Pete Hegseth – US Secretary of Defense - Alex 
 S. Johnson Tom Holman – Border Czar I&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; I.C.E. (US Im
 migration and Customs Enforcement) - Dario Cvencek Davis Ingle – White H
 ouse Spokesman 1\,500 Pardoned Insurrectionists\, January 6\, 2021 - Chris
 topher Bogart J&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Mike Johnson – Speaker of the House
  of Representatives. - Mike Jurkovic K&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Robert F. Kenn
 edy\, Jr. – US Secretary of Health and Human Services. - Susanna Rich Ja
 red Kushner – Special Peace Envoy - Dario Cvencek L &nbsp\;&nbsp\; Karol
 ine Levitt – former White House Press Secretary - Susanna Rich Howard Lu
 ttnick – US Secretary of Commerce - Canadian Poet M&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;
  Ghislaine Maxwell – Jeffrey Epstein co-conspirator - Raymond Nat Turner
  Linda McCann – US Secretary of Education Mitch McConnell – US Senator
 \, Tennessee - Patricia Carragon Stephen Miller – Deputy Chief-of-Staff 
 - Jan Steckel Markwayne Mullen – US Secretary of Homeland Security - Sue
  Storts Elon Musk – SGE of DOGE - John Trause N&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Kri
 sti Noem – Former Secretary of Homeland Security. - Pam Laskin O&nbsp\;&
 nbsp\;&nbsp\; Mehmet Oz – Administrator for the Centers of Medicare &amp
 \; Medicaid Services - Ameerah Shabazz P&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Kash Patel 
 – Director of the F.B.I.- Michael Sindler Jeanine Pirro – US Attorney\
 , District of Columbia Владимир Путин/Vladimir Putin – Pres
 ident of The Russian Federation - Christopher Bogart Q&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\
 ; Q’Anon – “a baseless\, far-right political conspiracy theory and p
 olitical movement.” (Wikipedia) - Laura Daniels R&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; J
 ohn Ratcliffe – Director of the C.I.A. Joe Rogan – Podcaster\, actor\,
  Trump supporter - Marcus D’Ambrosio Brooke Rollins – US Secretary of 
 Agriculture Marco Rubio – US Secretary of State - Crystal Davis S&nbsp\;
 &nbsp\;&nbsp\; Tim Scott – US Senator (R/SC) Elise Stefanik – US Ambas
 sador to the U.N. Roger Stone – Republican Political Operative T&nbsp\;&
 nbsp\;&nbsp\; Peter Theil – Billionaire\, Founder of Palantir Technologi
 es - Mike Jurkovic Clarence Thomas – US Supreme Court Justice - Margaret
  Sáraco D. J. T. Jr. – Eldest Son - Linda Johnston Muhlhausen U&nbsp\;&
 nbsp\;&nbsp\; Universities\, American V&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; J.D. Vance 
 – Vice-President of the United States - Linda Johnston Muhlhausen Russel
 l Vought – Director\, OMB - Rick Spisak W&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Susan Wiles – 
 White House Chief-of-Staff - Angie Williams Brown Steve Witkoff – Specia
 l Diplomatic Envoy X&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Space X/Starlink – American Ae
 rospace Technologies - John Trause Y&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\; Ye/Kanye West 
 – Rapper\, songwriter and record producer - Alex S. Johnson Z&nbsp\;&nbs
 p\;&nbsp\; Lee Zeldin – Administrator\, Environmental Protection Agency 
 - Jennifer M. Phillips Mark Zuckerberg – Founder\, C.E.O. of Meta and Fa
 cebook - Crystal Davis I encourage you to share this project description w
 ith fellow poets who you feel would be interested in participating. If you
  are interested in participating\, please email me with the “monkey(s)
 ” of your choice so that I can update the list. Remember\, while I don
 ’t mind the list of monkeys expanding\, and each poet taking up to three
  names\, I only want to include one poem per monkey. I don’t want to giv
 e any one of them more attention than any of the others. Hopefully\, that 
 will be given to them in the future by a jury of their peers. THEME: POETR
 Y ANTHOLOGY HOST: Christopher Bogart (Editor) FEATURES: FULL LIST TO BE A
 NNOUNCED PRICE: FREE CONTACT: Email cabogart@aol.com to submit poem(s)
LOCATION:NJ
URL:https://www.njpoetryevents.com/calendar/casablanca-press-the-flying-mo
 nkeys-project
